        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "501234fc-62d0-550a-b39a-0be416d7b233",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Walt Disney World Quest: Magical Racing Tour, Space Mountain\n- Places: Magic Kingdom, Florida, Shanghai Disneyland Resort\n- Organizations: The Walt Disney Company\n- Attractions: Haunted Mansion, Pirates of the Caribbean, Big Thunder Mountain Railroad\n- Characters: Chip 'n' Dale\n\nFacts:\n- On January 15, 1975, Space Mountain at Magic Kingdom opened in Florida.\n- Space Mountain is the oldest operating roller coaster in the state of Florida.\n- Space Mountain at Magic Kingdom is the original version of the attraction later replicated at all of The Walt Disney Company's Magic Kingdom-style theme parks worldwide except Shanghai Disneyland Resort.\n- In Walt Disney World Quest: Magical Racing Tour, players race on tracks inspired by Haunted Mansion, Pirates of the Caribbean, Space Mountain, and Big Thunder Mountain Railroad.\n- In Walt Disney World Quest: Magical Racing Tour, players compete to acquire missing parts for the park's fireworks machine.\n- In Walt Disney World Quest: Magical Racing Tour, Chip 'n' Dale accidentally destroyed the park's fireworks machine while gathering acorns.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
